  pp.<nbsp>378--384>>|<cell|Activities and their weighted
  norms>>|<row|<cell|Clipped kinetic term, local quadratic terms, regular
  errors, covering sum, exact coupling reset>|<cell|OpenAI's sigma-model
  papers: the exact map of<nbsp><cite-detail|OpenAI2026O4|Ÿ5,
  pp.<nbsp>38--55> and its adaptation<nbsp><cite-detail|OpenAI2026O3|Ÿ3.3,
  pp.<nbsp>23--28>>|<cell|The coordinates of the effective
